%clk 0:01:53] } Nf8 { [%clk 0:00:54] } 29. Rb2 { [%clk 0:01:28] } Ne6 { [%clk 0:00:51] } 30. Rab1 { [%clk 0:01:22] } Rf8 { [%clk 0:00:49] } 31. Bg4 { [%clk 0:00:54] } Bxg4 { [%clk 0:00:35] } 32. hxg4 { [%clk 0:00:53] } Qa4 { [%clk 0:00:33] } 33. Rb7 { [%clk 0:00:39] } Ref7 { [%clk 0:00:26] } 34. Rxf7+ { [%clk 0:00:30] } Rxf7 { [%clk 0:00:26] } 35. Qh3 { [%clk 0:00:18] } Qc2 { [%clk 0:00:17] } 36. Rf1 { [%clk 0:00:16] } Qxd2 { [%clk 0:00:16] } 37. Qxh4 { [%clk 0:00:16] } Nxd4 { [%clk 0:00:14] } 38. Qg5 { [%clk 0:00:14] } Ne2+ { [%clk 0:00:11] } 39. Kh1 { [%clk 0:00:12] } Qxg5 { [%clk 0:00:11] } 40. g3 { [%clk 0:00:10] } Qxg4 { [%clk 0:00:09] } 41. Kg2 { [%clk 0:00:10] } Qf3+ { [%clk 0:00:08] } 42. Kh3 { [%clk 0:00:08] } Nf4+ { [%clk 0:00:07] } 43. Kh2 { [%clk 0:00:08] } Qh5+ { [%clk 0:00:02] When you have mate in one, look for better. } (43... Qg2# { Would have won it. }) 44. Kg1 { [%clk 0:00:07] } Ne2+ { [%clk 0:00:01] } 45. Kg2 { [%clk 0:00:05] } Qf3+ { [%clk 0:00:00] } 46. Kh3 { [%clk 0:00:04] } Nf4+ { [%clk 0:00:00] } 47. Kh4 { [%clk 0:00:03] 1-0 White wins on time. Aman loses on time with mate in one on the board. Presumably playing with his food went wrong this game. } 1-0

